  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The Eagle Artillery is a high-damaging and durable defense that has a range that covers almost the entire map but has a blind spot similar to the Mortar. It is unlocked at Town Hall 11.",
    "Heroes and Spells that have been deployed regardless of level, will count towards the housing space needed to activate the Eagle Artillery. Each Hero is worth 25 troop housing spaces, and each spell housing space is worth 5 troop housing spaces.",
    "Each Siege Machine counts as 1 troop housing space towards this number. Clan Castle troops do not count towards this number, but any reinforcement spells count towards the normal amount.",
    "Dropping a Skeleton Spell, Bat Spell, or Totem Spell only adds the spell's equivalent worth of 5 troop housing spaces; the summoned units do not add more spaces."
  ],
  "notices": [
    "来源已停用该单位的蓄能；升级表以当前普通等级为准。"
  ]
